    "text": "The area of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
