  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Case - I: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0034_4d1264248d8b.png\" style=\"width: 299px; height: 62px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Case – II : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0034_4d1264248d8b.png\" style=\"width: 299px; height: 62px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0034_0a8de9530636.png\" style=\"width: 330px; height: 285px;\"/></p><p>So, the required area is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> {Take the mirror image of strips in the first quadrant to find the area}</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>·</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>·</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><msup><mn>4</mn><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
